# A whole round of Journey stage 1 (First Ford) to the results screen, driving
# the real UI: the pointer through the menus, then the board by keyboard (the
# selection starts on the ore mine; arrows move it, Enter builds a belt facing
# the Exchange), then auto-run (A) until every contract line is filled. Then
# Next stage starts stage 2.
until 300 Play
frames 10
click Play
until 60 Choose a mode
click Journey
until 60 First Ford
click First Ford
until 120 Run one tick (Space)
frames 5
key ArrowRight 2
frames 2
key Enter 2
until 30 Built a belt.
expect Gold: 54
key ArrowRight 2
frames 2
key Enter 2
frames 2
key ArrowRight 2
frames 2
key Enter 2
frames 2
key ArrowRight 2
frames 2
key Enter 2
frames 2
key ArrowDown 2
frames 2
key Enter 2
frames 2
key ArrowRight 2
frames 2
key Enter 2
until 30 Tick: 6 / 120
expect Gold: 24
key KeyA 2
until 30 Stop auto-run (A)
until 1800 Contracts complete
expect Score: 400
expect Ticks used: 32 / 120
click Next stage
until 120 Around the Rock
